+# Refer by name
+
+Every project, issue, numbered section, numbered item should have a **name** — its title. In everything the human reads — narration, tickets, maps, specs — never refer to these by only their id or number, but always also include their name. A wall of `#42, #43, #44` is illegible; names read at a glance. The id and URL don't vanish — a name wraps its link — but they ride _inside_ the name, never stand in for it.
